  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"two fifths x plus seven fifths y equals two sevenths\"><mfrac>\n\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t<mn>5</mn>\n</mfrac>\n<mrow>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<mn>7</mn>\n\t\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n<mrow>\n\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t<mn>7</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"g x plus k y equals five halves\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mi>g</mi>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mi>k</mi>\n\t\t\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">In the given system of equations, <math alttext=\"g\"><mi>g</mi>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"k\"><mi>k</mi>\n</math> are constants. The system has infinitely many solutions. What is the value of <math alttext=\"StartFraction g Over k EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<mi>g</mi>\n\t\t<mi>k</mi>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n</math>?</p>",
